  "description": "STAF.LLMEval is a .NET library and AI testing framework for evaluating LLM and GenAI responses in unit tests and CI/CD. Score AI outputs with pluggable metrics (exact, keyword, TF-IDF or embeddings semantic similarity, JSON/schema validation, relevance, heuristic grounding), LLM-as-judge, and RAG groundedness / hallucination detection. Includes fluent Eval API, rich assertions, Options/DI, JSON/JSONL/CSV evaluation suites, golden baseline comparison, opt-in run-history HTML trends, STAF-style HTML/JSON/Markdown/CSV reports, GitHub Actions / Azure DevOps CI templates, BenchmarkDotNet hot-path suite, and contributor docs. Works with OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Google Gemini, Ollama, Anthropic Claude, Groq, and Mistral on .NET 8/9/10. Meta-package depends on STAF.LLMEval.Core (+ Abstractions); optional STAF.LLMEval.SemanticKernel.",
